<title>CANADA: Olco to buy back 5 pct of Class A shares.</title>
<headline>Olco to buy back 5 pct of Class A shares.</headline>
<dateline>MONTREAL 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Olco Petroleum Group Inc said on Wednesday that under a normal course issuer bid it would buy back to 777,700 Class A shares, or 5 percent of the 15.5 million outstanding.</p>
<p>The shares may be bought through the Montreal Exchange from October 18 to October 17, 1997. During the previous 12 months, Olco repurchased 35,000 Class A shares at the average price of C$0.54.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Montreal bureau (514) 985-2434</p>
